[{"id":185076753,"discussion_id":"17323f854ec9e6f4de0e15f1d619a174c87a8b8b","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 主要针对 `ImgWarpResize` 算子在边界场景下的精度问题进行修复：将坐标取整逻辑由 `int32` 截断改为 `floorf`/`np.floor`，并调整双线性插值的浮点运算顺序，使 kernel 与 golden 均按 `sub -> mul -> add` 的 `TBE` 顺序执行，从而避免负坐标及非有限坐标因 `int32` 窄化或运算顺序差异导致的精度偏差。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **取整逻辑修复**: `img_warp_resize_simt.h` 中 `xFloat`/`yFloat` 的取整由 `static_cast<int32_t>` 截断改为 `floorf(xFloat)`/`floorf(yFloat)`，使负数与非有限坐标不再发生 `int32` 窄化。\n- **Golden 取整逻辑同步**: `golden.py` 中 `lerp_x_data`/`lerp_y_data` 的取整由 `astype(np.int32)` 改为 `np.floor`，与 kernel 的 `floorf` 行为保持一致。\n- **双线性插值运算顺序调整**: `img_warp_resize_simt.h` 将水平与垂直插值拆分为显式的 `sub -> mul -> add` 步骤，并使用 `topDelta`、`topProduct`、`verticalDelta` 等 `float32` 中间变量。\n- **Golden 插值顺序同步**: `golden.py` 同样将 `top`、`bottom`、`out` 的计算改为 `top_delta`、`top_product`、`vertical_delta` 等显式中间变量的 `sub -> mul -> add` 顺序，保证与 kernel 对齐。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-17T11:44:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T11:51:05+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185076760,"discussion_id":"9f4f832444b415f2f4acfcc958272c45891bde18","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-17T11:44:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T12:06:38+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185076808,"discussion_id":"64cf809c296c75c5a81362530e68d202af18d8dc","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be f