界场景下的精度问题。2 个文件，kernel 与 golden 同步修改。**未发现客观 bug。**\n\n---\n\n### 变更分析\n\n#### 1. floor 语义修正：int32 截断 → float32 floorf\n\n```cpp\n// 旧：static_cast<int32_t> 向零截断，负数/NaN/Inf 未定义行为\nint32_t xInt = static_cast<int32_t>(xFloat);\nfloat xLerp = xFloat - static_cast<float>(xInt);\n\n// 新：floorf 向负无穷取整，非有限值自然传播\nfloat xLerp = xFloat - floorf(xFloat);\n```\n\n| 输入 | 旧行为 | 新行为 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| -1.5 | 截断 → -1，lerp=-0.5 | floor → -2，lerp=0.5 ✅ |\n| NaN | `static_cast<int32_t>(NaN)` UB | NaN 自然传播 ✅ |\n| +Inf | `static_cast<int32_t>(Inf)` UB | Inf-Inf=NaN ✅ |\n| 1e10（超 int32） | astype 溢出 | float32 内保持 ✅ |\n\n#### 2. 插值顺序分解：单表达式 → sub/mul/add 三步\n\n```cpp\n// 旧：可被编译器收缩为 FMA\nfloat top = topLeft + (topRight - topLeft) * xLerp;\n\n// 新：显式三步，匹配 TBE 源码顺序\nfloat topDelta = topRight - topLeft;\nfloat topProduct = topDelta * xLerp;\nfloat top = topLeft + topProduct;\n```\n\n#### 3. golden 同步\n\n`astype(np.int32)` → `np.floor()`，与 kernel 语义一致。\n\n---\n\n### 亮点\n\n- kernel/golden 双端同步修改，避免单端漂移\n- 注释说明改动原因（TBE 顺序对齐、负坐标/非有限值规避）\n\n---","created_at":"2026-08-18T14:45:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-18T14:45:30+08:00","user":{"id":"686253426134b2596efc1cd9","login":"liu-wei","object_id":"686253426134b2596efc1cd9","name":"liu-wei","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ee/cd/eec19811dc7cf8455ff842f34fe264521e857510526454b9e5903256dd69be2b.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liu-wei"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185310952,"discussion_id":"83bf20c13b0b88fa10adc3f82d0d7fa29f1d0671","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-08-18T14:46:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-18T14:46:30+08:00","user":{"id":"686253426134b2596efc1cd9","login":"liu-wei","object_id":"686253426134b2596efc1cd9","name":"liu-wei","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ee/cd/eec19811dc7cf8455ff842f34fe264521e857510526454b9e5903256dd69be2b.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liu-wei"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185475755,"discussion_id":"a3844bfca07f745e918eda5425f10c01760c5ed2","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-08-19T10:33:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-19T10:33:59+08:00","user":{"id":"68ad1e460f9a7255ef7a79e1","login":"pingchuantang","object_id":"68ad1e460f9a7255ef7a79e1","name":"TangPC","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/cc/cb/54c196c65c928b997e66a9d6e53d357e4a5c63e61d32874f3d3a5953d364de62.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/pingchuantang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]